editor_description = "A unit's COMMANDER on the armoured horse, carrying his realm's banner (spec 2026-11-27-commander-figure-design): one figure, no men. Surface 0 is the body, horse and staff on the atlas; surface 1 is the banner's cloth, plain here: the game sets the realm's flag on it (Map3DCommanderFigure.set_flag). Clips MARCH (the gallop), MARCH_WALK, STANDBY, COMMAND; their loops are the .glb's import settings. Its materials, shadow and look are edited HERE."

